  "post_title": "Hosturionda presenta la guerra de arroces (y fideuà)",
  "post_date": "2015-07-07 21:57:46",
  "post_name": "hosturionda-presenta-la-guerra-de-arroces-y-fideua",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P1110310.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, y el presidente de Hosturionda, Manuel Llorens Porcar, han presentado en el restaurante Toledo la II edici&oacute;n de la guerra de arroces, que este a&ntilde;o incluye tambi&eacute;n fiedu&agrave; en tres de los trece locales (entre ellos, Man&aacute; Bar) que participan: el propio Toledo (representado por Javier Lozar), Bacchus Gastrobar (estaba &Aacute;lvaro Chaves) y El Cid.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/CartellGuerraArrossos10al26.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 752px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Por 18 euros se puede comer dos entrantes y arroz o fideu&agrave;, adem&aacute;s de postre, caf&eacute;s y bebidas aparte. Consiguiendo el cu&ntilde;o de tres locales, se participa en el sorteo de 13 vales de 20 euros, uno por local.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/cartellguerraarrossos10al26.jpg\" alt=\"cartellguerraarrossos10al26\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos1.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos2.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos3.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos4.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos5.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos6.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos6\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos7.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos7\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos8.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos8\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/llibretguerraarrosos9.jpg\" alt=\"llibretguerraarrosos9\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110307.jpg\" alt=\"p1110307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110309.jpg\" alt=\"p1110309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110310.jpg\" alt=\"p1110310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110311.jpg\" alt=\"p1110311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110315.jpg\" alt=\"p1110315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110316.jpg\" alt=\"p1110316\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110317.jpg\" alt=\"p1110317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenguerraarrossosifideua15/p1110319.jpg\" alt=\"p1110319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
